n  future retrace your steps on the metal  walkway but this time stay right and go  into the room with  safe the code is nine one eight if you'd  like the optics for your pistol the  bobble head in here is hiding on the  shelving unit be careful though there's  a zombie in here who's super quick  bobblehead eight and nine are very close  continue through the next few doors and  you'll exit onto the street but don't go  any further  instead look up and you'll see another  bubble head waiting to be shot the ninth  collectible is also here just turn to  your left  and on top of the building with the neon  signs is bobblehead nine easy claps now  onto bobblehead 10 but while here we're  going to do a little prep work for  future secret bobbleheads pick up the  high-grade gunpowder it's essential that  you do not combine this with regular  gunpowder we need to make Magnum ammo to  trigger another bobblehead but more on  that a little later around the next  corner is a dead zombie he's laying on  top of yet another secret bobblehead  but we can't get that just yet so  remember this spot the one we actually  came here for is here exit the pharmacy  and stick to the right and enter this  building you'll stumble across the whole  pipe but do not grab it yet if we pick  that up it will trigger more zombies to  spawn in and the nemesis will become  active and remember he's literally  unkillable so don't bother picking this  up not just yet anyway going to the room  with and straight away on your left is  the bobblehead exit the building and  continue into the donut shop immediately  turn right and hiding next to the  microwave is bobblehead number 12 before  leaving the donut shop go to the back  room which is also a safe room and drop  off any unwanted items here be sure to  grab the bolt cutters  we need those next exit the donut shop  and head straight over to the locked  fence use your bolt cutters but after  doing so three zombies will be activated  the first one is on the right and the  next two around the corner fake them out  and destroy the barrel to stay super  safe  round the corner is the bobblehead he's  hiding in little cubbyhole here you can  also grab some shotgun shells but I  recommend the grenade if you have the  inventory space now we're going all the  way back through the donut place and up  the steps turn right to stumble across  another locked up star use those bolt  cutters again the bobble head here is  sat just by the tilt or the cash  register  remember the Gunpowder we picked up  earlier well now in this star we're  going to continue working on that hidden  bobble head just on the shelves is  another batch of high-grade gunpowder  pick it up and combine it with the one  we picked up earlier on to craft Magnum  ammo from here we are going all the way  back to the start of the game to see  Victor when we get there he says this  the combination of the Magnum ammo we  just made and talking to Victor has  spawned in yet another bobble head but  while we're here there's one we can get  nice and easy go towards the blocked  exit of the subway for another cheeky  bobble head on the opposite platform  that's fifteen five more to go back on  the Main Street head up to the roof  section if you knock down the ladder  this is much easier and much quicker  you'll notice a zombie has been moved  and look what's beside him bobble head  sixteen okay so those are the bobble  heads we can grab without triggering  nemesis but for the last four we need to  get him in play it's unavoidable  so Trek all the way back down to grab  the hose pipe and remember to grab any  other munitions you can especially the  grenades they're bloody great venturing  through the donut shop and we will see  nemesis take out your grenade  immediately and toss it this will knock  the nemesis about 30 seconds and it also  counts towards another secret bobblehead  we're already working on but we'll get  to that soon while he's down - run  straight past him